{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（21日）上午9時31分，警方接獲一名負責人報案，指其位於牛池灣彩雲商場的日本城懷疑遭人爆竊，共損失約3000元現金。現場消息指，涉事日本城的後門有被撬開的痕跡，店內收銀機雜亂。警員到場翻查閉路電視，經調查後，相信賊人從後門撬門進入犯案。</p><figure><img alt=\"警員在店內調查。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260621/1145313577872134144041732.jpeg/RBglnObf0KE6e2X5hYLfFZqvk65dq0SJLolJAguJSQI\"/><figcaption>警員在店內調查。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事日本城。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260621/1145311616137433088916538.jpeg/2KiLHcfOa4DUSVR4Qa-e7F1rZIzQCdJ17QPgiMgD4Ig\"/><figcaption>涉事日本城。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在店內調查。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260621/1145313426776526848263975.jpeg/wh8JheCIG-88rZK2FM0uR-jB4EK226Pmhb_AzqC_wM4\"/><figcaption>警員在店內調查。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在店內調查。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260621/1145311551574511616149682.jpeg/PtUQc5L3-wZpDnzClF4KYmIanXlMe7dX3HEtWPlxLVg\"/><figcaption>警員在店內調查。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在店內調查。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260621/1145311553843761152530861.jpeg/nHYM9Gcd9Ekdc50TRLEl5uyg9Y9ZJt4AoJaAnYWWgJ0\"/><figcaption>警員在店內調查。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在店內調查。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260621/1145311556146565120836241.jpeg/l7SsDSY_JkdMxb5QxIq4lgjeHQFA8R4yqMD6Wo3A-lo\"/><figcaption>警員在店內調查。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"賊人懷疑從後門進入。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260621/1145311558432591872602431.jpeg/g_YqO_54AqT79sTmLLZxf_U34Nr3anJuDZ0A4CidAOA\"/><figcaption>賊人懷疑從後門進入。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"賊人懷疑從後門進入。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260621/1145311560576012288435179.jpeg/pTslM5LRhDNb3SoePIX8MScjrD3Jm0Sa4uxCk8fsQpM\"/><figcaption>賊人懷疑從後門進入。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場翻查閉路電視記錄。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260621/1145311551025057792429176.jpeg/leAJMZpTRM8C_CTYD7GwGQ7xhLKLUv-847rY6ca62Ok\"/><figcaption>警員在場翻查閉路電視記錄。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-21T02:59:00.550322+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":263,"images":9,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}